<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Ikon started as neutral.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Ikon started as neutral.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morgan Stanley said on Tuesday it initiated coverage of Ikon Office Solutions Inc with a neutral rating.  </p>
<p>-- Further details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- On June 19, Ikon said its net earnings for the third and fourth quarters would be below analysts' estimates. The company said it expected to earn about $0.30 to $0.32 per share in the third quarter, excluding $18 million to $22 million in business transformation costs.</p>
<p>-- The stock lost 1/16 to 26-3/8.</p>
<p>((Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
